                    memorandum. McFarlane wrote in the upper right-hand corner of the memorandum,
                    “Terrific work.” (Reagan Library, Rosenberg Files, Food for Progress-Keating
                    Group [Famine] 5/23/1984–06/06/1984)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
